      <div type="clause" n="40.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 40.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon in lenctenne halig ryht in folce butan leafe alecgge, gebete mid CXX scill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone in the folk sets aside holy law without dispensation during Lent, let him compensate with 120 shillings</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone, without permission, publicly disregards the laws of the Church during Lent, he shall pay 120 shillings compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon on lencten halig ryht on folce butan leafe alecgge, gebete mid cxx scill.</ab>
